<title>INDIA: India's Tamil Nadu News 96/97 net falls.</title>
<headline>India's Tamil Nadu News 96/97 net falls.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>	     (in million rupees unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		  166.47 vs    782.39</p>
<p>    Net sales		 4,192.77 vs  2,946.80</p>
<p>    Other income		167.68 vs    109.55</p>
<p>    Expenditure	     3,013.68 vs  1,714.31</p>
<p>    Interest costs	    702.26 vs    326.25</p>
<p>    Depreciation		478.03 vs    233.39</p>
<p>    Tax			   nil    vs    nil</p>
<p>Note: Tamil Nadu Newsprint &amp; Papers Ltd said the minimum alternate tax worked out to 21.47 million rupees. It said the results for 1996/96 were unaudited.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
